# The "!" folder-name prefix forces this addon to load FIRST (3.3.5 loads addons
# alphabetically by folder; "!" sorts before letters/digits — the standard
# !BugGrabber/!Swatter trick). There is no in-.toc load-priority field. Loading
# first is deliberate MEASUREMENT: the LoadProfile can only attribute addons that
# load AFTER its ADDON_LOADED listener exists, so loading early captures nearly the
# whole cascade and shrinks the un-attributable `pre=` floor. /cpp load self-verifies
# it worked (small pre=, high addon count). Not a mitigation — it changes what we can
# SEE, not the client's behavior.
#
# Load order within this addon: pure/dependency-free modules first, driver last.
RingBuffer.lua
Report.lua
Meter.lua
LoadProfile.lua
MemWalk.lua
Storm.lua
Probe.lua
Events.lua
